WEBVTT

01:22.668 --> 01:26.881
DELICIOUS IN DUNGEON

01:38.017 --> 01:40.936
Aw, rats. This one's locked too.

01:41.020 --> 01:42.313
Just give me a sec.

01:44.023 --> 01:47.693
Guys, we've been walking for a while now,

01:47.777 --> 01:50.196
how's about we set up camp here
and rest for a bit?

01:53.616 --> 01:55.910
Letting your stomach
do the talking. Classy.

01:56.535 --> 01:58.954
It wasn't me, darn it!

01:59.538 --> 02:01.123
It figures she's hungry.

02:01.207 --> 02:03.834
We've been eating snacks all day
and nothing else.

02:04.418 --> 02:07.797
I don't think it's a good idea
to stop just yet though, Laios.

02:07.880 --> 02:09.924
The only food
we managed to find today

02:10.007 --> 02:12.218
is about a bowl's worth
of Treasure Insects.

02:13.469 --> 02:16.097
I say we keep going
and get to the fourth floor.

02:16.806 --> 02:18.682
Well, I hear you,

02:18.766 --> 02:22.353
but the monsters
are just gonna get stronger from here on.

02:22.436 --> 02:24.814
I think it's important
we stay well-rested.

02:24.897 --> 02:27.691
Still, you're right, we need food,

02:27.775 --> 02:29.443
or we won't have the energy to fight.

02:29.527 --> 02:31.320
But to have the energy to fight,

02:31.404 --> 02:33.489
we need rest, and now I'm confused.

02:33.572 --> 02:35.324
Uh?

02:35.408 --> 02:36.700
It's open.

02:45.918 --> 02:48.838
Looks like this used to be a dining hall.

02:48.921 --> 02:51.841
I bet it was something to see
back in the day.

02:57.805 --> 03:01.100
The only ones using this room now
are the undead.

03:01.183 --> 03:02.601
Even the rats stay away.

03:02.685 --> 03:04.728
Uh, good, 'cause I refuse to eat rats.

03:06.564 --> 03:09.734
I wish we'd get attacked
by something other than some dumb ghosts.

03:09.817 --> 03:12.653
It'd be awesome
if a roast pig came charging in.

03:12.737 --> 03:14.238
Hmph, what are you talking about?

03:15.239 --> 03:16.782
We should be so lucky.

03:17.700 --> 03:19.118
Wait.

03:19.660 --> 03:20.828
We are!

03:21.579 --> 03:23.414
We got food right in front of us!

03:27.334 --> 03:28.878
It's a Living Picture!

03:28.961 --> 03:30.004
Laios, get back!

03:31.589 --> 03:32.840
Uh?

03:32.923 --> 03:34.216
What are you thinking?

03:34.300 --> 03:35.384
It almost sucked you in!

03:35.468 --> 03:38.345
I know!
That was the plan and you ruined it!

03:38.429 --> 03:39.263
What?

03:39.346 --> 03:42.266
Look at all those fat,
juicy grapes she's got.

03:42.850 --> 03:44.185
Just so we're clear here,

03:44.268 --> 03:46.937
your plan was to eat the food
in the painting?

03:47.021 --> 03:49.523
That's right.
It's a good idea, don't you think?

03:49.607 --> 03:51.776
-That's the dumbest idea ever!
-Yeah, if you're stupid!

03:51.859 --> 03:54.695
You know what it means
to chase &quot;the pie in the sky&quot;, don't ya?

03:54.779 --> 03:58.449
Yeah, but I'm not after
some imaginary pie I can't eat.

03:58.532 --> 04:00.034
If these are Living Paintings,

04:00.117 --> 04:02.369
then the pies in them should be eatable.

04:03.162 --> 04:05.456
Okay, but you could also
get killed in there.

04:05.539 --> 04:06.957
My point is,

04:07.041 --> 04:10.711
if I'm in the painting, then I can fight
for the food in the painting too.

04:15.049 --> 04:17.384
Oh, whatever. Give it a try then.

04:17.468 --> 04:19.094
And if you die, that's on you.

04:19.178 --> 04:20.137
Deal.

04:20.221 --> 04:22.181
-I'll tie this rope to you.
-Hm?

04:23.307 --> 04:25.684
Your rope tugged,
and we'll pull you back out.

04:26.185 --> 04:28.354
Now, which painting?

04:29.188 --> 04:31.607
Ah, this one looks like it will work.

04:31.690 --> 04:33.776
There's food waiting on the table.

04:34.318 --> 04:36.487
Right, do your thing, Painting!

04:46.705 --> 04:48.249
Ow.

04:48.332 --> 04:49.750
-Who are you?
-Uh?

04:49.834 --> 04:51.710
Crap. I've been spotted!

04:52.253 --> 04:53.629
-Your sword…
-Huh?

04:54.213 --> 04:56.340
I've never seen armor like that,

04:56.423 --> 04:58.467
but you are a palace guard, aren't you?

04:58.551 --> 04:59.385
Uh…

04:59.468 --> 05:00.386
-Huh?
-Here!

05:00.469 --> 05:02.638
Let's go, there's no time to waste!

05:02.721 --> 05:05.349
For goodness sake,
I never have enough help.

05:06.225 --> 05:08.727
Hurry now. Stop dawdling back there.

05:09.228 --> 05:10.145
Uh?

05:13.232 --> 05:16.652
My word.
What a clever-looking boy we have.

05:16.735 --> 05:20.656
True. And did you notice?
He has your nose.

05:20.739 --> 05:24.660
When you grow up, little one,
you shall become a great king.

05:26.036 --> 05:29.164
King Freinag, I'm so happy for you.

05:29.790 --> 05:31.333
Don't just stand there!

05:31.417 --> 05:33.168
-Hurry up! Bring the rest!
-Uh…

05:33.252 --> 05:36.672
-I, um, could use a--
-I have it!

05:36.755 --> 05:40.676
Delgal! Your name is Prince Delgal!

05:42.344 --> 05:45.306
And one day, you shall be king, Delgal!

05:45.389 --> 05:46.390
That does it!

05:46.473 --> 05:47.933
I lost my appetite!

05:49.810 --> 05:52.229
I'm so ready to go!

05:53.147 --> 05:54.481
He wants out!

05:54.565 --> 05:56.692
Let's go!

05:59.528 --> 06:00.821
Well?

06:02.531 --> 06:05.993
I was this close
to eating something there.

06:06.076 --> 06:09.246
But then, the mood in the room
killed my appetite!

06:09.330 --> 06:11.665
-The what?
-Why is the mood a problem?

06:11.749 --> 06:14.877
How do you expect a guy to eat
if the vibe's weird?

06:15.461 --> 06:16.462
Anyway, look,

06:16.545 --> 06:19.089
I know I can do this.
I just need to find the right setting.

06:19.173 --> 06:21.383
Okay, and what would that be?

06:21.467 --> 06:22.635
I don't know.

06:22.718 --> 06:25.888
Like maybe something more casual.

06:29.224 --> 06:30.726
&quot;Casual&quot;?

06:31.727 --> 06:34.146
Hey, how about this one?

06:34.647 --> 06:36.523
Everyone looks like they're having fun.

06:36.607 --> 06:38.442
There's even a naked guy dancing.

06:38.525 --> 06:39.902
Perfect! Here I go!

06:40.945 --> 06:42.613
Whoa!

06:46.075 --> 06:48.327
Huh?

06:49.328 --> 06:50.996
You drunken fool!

06:51.080 --> 06:53.582
-You are in the presence of the prince!
-Wait!

06:53.666 --> 06:54.875
Ow! Stop it!

06:54.959 --> 06:56.752
Get off the table already!

06:56.835 --> 06:57.878
Leave him be.

06:58.963 --> 07:00.881
Today is my wedding day.

07:01.548 --> 07:04.635
This man was just celebrating,
not being insolent.

07:04.718 --> 07:06.845
Uh, but, Prince Delgal…

07:07.513 --> 07:08.555
Delgal?

07:08.639 --> 07:10.891
The baby from the other painting?

07:10.974 --> 07:12.309
Go on then!

07:13.060 --> 07:14.395
Hm.

07:14.478 --> 07:15.771
That was close.

07:16.480 --> 07:17.648
Delgal!

07:17.731 --> 07:19.400
Father!

07:19.483 --> 07:23.237
I am so proud
of how fine a man you have become.

07:24.321 --> 07:26.532
Here's to you and the kingdom.

07:30.828 --> 07:32.371
Oh, wow!

07:41.505 --> 07:43.215
Father!

07:48.303 --> 07:51.306
Guess I'll grab what I can
and eat when I get back.

07:55.144 --> 07:56.061
Oh?

07:56.145 --> 07:58.564
-Sorry.
-Your Highness!

07:59.148 --> 08:00.482
He needs a doctor.

08:00.566 --> 08:01.442
Go and find him!

08:01.525 --> 08:04.611
That elf
was in the other painting too.

08:04.695 --> 08:06.447
Is he the court jester?

08:08.157 --> 08:09.199
Whoa!

08:11.285 --> 08:12.703
Check it out, guys!

08:12.786 --> 08:14.455
I brought a whole bunch of goodies back.

08:14.538 --> 08:16.707
So let's get the-- Where the hell is it?

08:18.542 --> 08:21.712
I guess the painting
won't let me take food with me.

08:21.795 --> 08:24.465
I'll have to eat what I can
while I'm still inside it!

08:24.548 --> 08:25.591
That does it!

08:25.674 --> 08:28.302
I'm gonna taste Painting food
this time or else!

08:32.306 --> 08:33.599
Huh?

08:33.682 --> 08:37.603
FULL-COURSE OF COURT CUISINE

08:38.270 --> 08:39.313
Huh?

08:40.689 --> 08:43.400
Looks like a coronation ceremony.

08:43.942 --> 08:46.445
So that prince inherited the crown.

08:48.947 --> 08:51.366
I shall pray for the eternal prosperity

08:51.450 --> 08:53.994
of the country and its people.

08:56.455 --> 08:58.582
Uh? Huh?

09:03.086 --> 09:04.379
Delicious!

09:09.384 --> 09:10.344
Delicious!

09:10.427 --> 09:12.805
I thought it would taste like paint,

09:12.888 --> 09:15.057
but this is a real feast!

09:26.568 --> 09:28.737
Um, can I have some more?

09:33.075 --> 09:34.743
That was great.

09:35.327 --> 09:37.412
Man, I'm stuffed.

09:38.956 --> 09:41.124
Okay, time to head back.

09:41.875 --> 09:42.751
Huh?

09:45.087 --> 09:47.005
Hey, it's that same elf.

09:48.799 --> 09:51.635
-What are you doing here, outsider?
-
Uh-oh!

09:52.344 --> 09:53.720
I remember.

09:53.804 --> 09:56.849
You were there when the prince was born
and his wedding.

09:57.850 --> 09:59.518
What do you want?

09:59.601 --> 10:01.270
Are you after the throne?

10:03.438 --> 10:06.150
I will burn your flesh to ash!

10:09.570 --> 10:10.737
-Too close.
-Huh?

10:14.074 --> 10:16.952
What happened this time? You get to eat?

10:17.619 --> 10:20.747
I was at a table
with a huge feast in front of me.

10:20.831 --> 10:23.458
I ate as much as I could
and got up to leave,

10:24.042 --> 10:27.421
then someone noticed I didn't belong there
and grabbed my collar.

10:28.088 --> 10:30.215
He was so pissed at me.

10:30.299 --> 10:31.884
You did crash his party.

10:33.093 --> 10:34.553
I was so scared.

10:36.179 --> 10:37.139
Uh?

10:37.222 --> 10:40.517
How could I be hungry again
after eating all that food?

10:40.601 --> 10:42.019
Oh, damn!

10:42.102 --> 10:45.022
I had the best meal
and none of it came back with me!

10:45.105 --> 10:47.107
See?

10:47.191 --> 10:49.526
-Told you it was a dumb idea, dummy!
-Ow!

10:49.610 --> 10:51.153
Thanks for wasting our time!

10:51.236 --> 10:54.114
I mean, maybe,
but the food did taste good.

10:59.703 --> 11:02.080
I guess this is the kitchen?

11:03.290 --> 11:04.875
There's water in the next room,

11:04.958 --> 11:07.753
so this should be a good enough place
to set up camp.

11:08.545 --> 11:10.547
We could've reached
the fourth floor by now

11:10.631 --> 11:13.258
if you weren't goofing off
in those damn paintings.

11:16.595 --> 11:17.512
Mm?

11:19.097 --> 11:21.892
My gut's telling me
that's a Mimic.

11:21.975 --> 11:22.976
The fourth floor…

11:23.060 --> 11:25.896
That chest definitely wasn't there before.

11:25.979 --> 11:28.774
It's in a perfect spot to get attention.

11:28.857 --> 11:30.901
Not too hidden, not too obvious.

11:31.485 --> 11:34.821
The kind of spot
those bastards love to ambush you from.

11:35.864 --> 11:39.117
Well, guys,
how about we get some sleep here?

11:39.201 --> 11:40.619
-Okay.
-Got it.

11:41.161 --> 11:42.454
-Chilchuck? Sound good?
-Huh?

11:42.537 --> 11:43.914
Uh, sure.

11:47.542 --> 11:49.795
Better not tell them about the Mimic.

11:49.878 --> 11:52.965
I know Laios and Senshi
would want to eat it.

11:53.048 --> 11:54.967
Which means I'll have to open the chest.

11:55.050 --> 11:55.884
No, thanks.

11:57.719 --> 11:59.096
Mimics…

11:59.179 --> 12:02.724
Over the years, those bastards
caused me nothing but grief!

12:03.725 --> 12:04.935
Oh, good.

12:05.018 --> 12:06.770
It's not locked and there's no trap!

12:11.650 --> 12:14.736
I had to pick the lock on this one
so it can't be a Mimic!

12:23.203 --> 12:25.664
If I open it from here, it can't grab me!

12:28.000 --> 12:30.877
Crap! I forgot there's another trap!

12:35.841 --> 12:37.384
Damn Mimics!

12:38.510 --> 12:39.553
Are you okay?

12:39.636 --> 12:42.055
-What?
-You're all quiet.

12:42.639 --> 12:44.016
Is something bothering you?

12:44.766 --> 12:46.059
Me? Uh-uh.

12:46.143 --> 12:47.936
I bet he's tired.

12:48.020 --> 12:49.396
I say we let the kid sleep

12:49.479 --> 12:51.857
and one of us
can take his turn keeping watch.

12:52.482 --> 12:54.317
For the last time, I'm not a kid!

12:54.943 --> 12:56.153
How old are you then?

12:56.236 --> 12:57.571
None of your business.

12:57.654 --> 13:00.866
Oh, jeez. Why are you always so secretive?

13:00.949 --> 13:03.577
You never told us your age
or where you're from.

13:03.660 --> 13:06.872
I'd like to keep my work
and personal life separate.

13:06.955 --> 13:08.415
If that's what you want,

13:08.498 --> 13:10.083
but one day, you'll regret it.

13:10.167 --> 13:11.960
-Whatever.
-You grumpity old grump.

13:18.425 --> 13:20.886
My stomach's gone soft on me.

13:20.969 --> 13:23.847
I used to be able
to go two days without eating.

13:25.932 --> 13:27.225
I need more water.

13:28.185 --> 13:29.770
Hey, clumsy head.

13:32.522 --> 13:34.191
I'm gonna go get some water.

13:35.776 --> 13:37.944
Wait up, I'll go with you.

13:38.028 --> 13:39.571
Nah. I'll be all right.

13:40.238 --> 13:41.740
Okay, but watch your back.

13:41.823 --> 13:43.575
It's in the next room.

13:51.249 --> 13:52.334
Uh?

13:55.712 --> 13:57.172
A Coin Insect.

13:57.255 --> 13:59.174
Maybe there's a nest around here.

13:59.674 --> 14:02.052
If I find a few more, I'll have a meal.

14:04.096 --> 14:07.474
I'm not as hardcore as Laios,
but Coin Insects are good.

14:08.058 --> 14:10.268
They're copycats, like those damn Mimics,

14:10.352 --> 14:11.269
just cuter.

14:11.353 --> 14:12.521
Wait!

14:12.604 --> 14:14.856
Don't go in there, the Mimic's hiding--

14:17.859 --> 14:19.236
Oh, great.

14:19.319 --> 14:22.531
I forgot the weight
of this waterskin made me heavier.

14:23.115 --> 14:25.742
There should be a lever around here.

14:27.035 --> 14:29.037
And I can't reach it.

14:29.663 --> 14:31.248
Should I yell for help?

14:31.331 --> 14:34.126
Better not,
the sound might draw other monsters,

14:34.209 --> 14:35.752
putting everyone in danger.

14:35.836 --> 14:36.711
No worries.

14:36.795 --> 14:39.131
Marcille will notice I didn't come back
and come looking.

14:39.840 --> 14:40.882
What am I saying?

14:40.966 --> 14:42.968
Knowing her, she went right back to sleep!

14:43.718 --> 14:45.178
Take a breath!

14:45.262 --> 14:47.389
Opening doors is my specialty.

14:47.931 --> 14:49.683
I can do this. No sweat!

14:50.892 --> 14:53.395
I need to find the mechanism
to open the door.

14:53.979 --> 14:56.440
I'll be fine
if I stay away from the Mimic.

14:56.523 --> 14:58.734
I don't hear
any ticking noises behind the wall,

14:58.817 --> 15:00.402
so there's no time limit.

15:01.153 --> 15:02.904
I can tell there are switches on the walls

15:02.988 --> 15:06.283
which probably make spears
shoot up from the floor.

15:06.366 --> 15:08.910
If I push them in the wrong order,
I'm done for.

15:09.828 --> 15:13.123
I bet the words on this plate
are my key to getting out of here.

15:13.999 --> 15:17.043
If only I could read
this ancient language.

15:17.127 --> 15:19.588
Marcille could, but she ain't here.

15:20.714 --> 15:23.675
I feel like I've seen
this kind of writing before.

15:24.634 --> 15:27.095
Never mind, better go over what I know.

15:27.846 --> 15:30.140
There's three switches
in the corners of the room.

15:30.223 --> 15:31.391
Why three?

15:31.474 --> 15:33.727
And in what order do I have to push them?

15:36.605 --> 15:39.441
There's another switch on the wall
by the Mimic!

15:39.524 --> 15:42.652
I'm gonna have to deal
with that rotten thing after all!

15:42.736 --> 15:44.696
Maybe there's a hint somewhere.

15:45.322 --> 15:47.157
I should be so lucky.

15:47.949 --> 15:50.744
If I hit the switches randomly,
I'll get skewered.

15:51.369 --> 15:53.788
I'm tiny, so maybe I can avoid them.

15:54.581 --> 15:55.999
Nope, too risky.

15:56.082 --> 15:59.127
Ugh, I have no idea
what I'm supposed to do!

16:02.756 --> 16:05.425
Guess all I can do
is wait till the others…

16:06.384 --> 16:07.427
wake?

16:09.596 --> 16:11.890
Golly!

16:14.184 --> 16:15.060
Oh, crap!

16:21.483 --> 16:24.402
Do close calls get any closer?

16:31.201 --> 16:33.161
Damn, these things are tough!

16:34.788 --> 16:37.874
When you flip a Mimic over,
the way it struggles is cute.

16:38.625 --> 16:41.545
With its belly up,
you can see if it's a boy or a girl.

16:42.128 --> 16:45.549
I don't wanna hear
his stupid trivia before I die!

16:46.174 --> 16:49.135
Besides, how can I flip it over?

16:49.219 --> 16:50.178
There's no way!

16:51.805 --> 16:53.682
Here goes nothing!

17:05.944 --> 17:06.986
Damn Mimic.

17:07.070 --> 17:09.698
Hopefully, the others heard me and--

17:10.949 --> 17:11.825
Huh?

17:11.908 --> 17:14.828
You were empty this whole time?
You son of a--

17:14.911 --> 17:16.371
Wait.

17:16.454 --> 17:17.664
These letters.

17:18.915 --> 17:21.209
They're the same ones
as the one on the plate.

17:21.293 --> 17:23.503
I know what these mean,
so I can figure out--

17:23.586 --> 17:24.546
Ah!

17:24.629 --> 17:25.463
Oh, crap!

17:25.547 --> 17:26.965
-
&quot;The sun shall rise…
-East!

17:27.048 --> 17:28.967
-
…the moon shall set…
-And West!

17:29.050 --> 17:30.844
-
…the stars shall brightly shine…
-North!

17:31.511 --> 17:33.388
Whoa! The South is next!

17:33.930 --> 17:38.268
And the winds of fortune
shall blow your way forever!&quot;

17:40.353 --> 17:41.479
Got it!

17:41.563 --> 17:43.648
Ah!

17:55.035 --> 17:58.747
Come on!
Chilchuck hasn't come back yet!

18:00.582 --> 18:02.459
Uh?

18:03.585 --> 18:05.837
Chil… Chilchuck!

18:05.920 --> 18:08.173
He's dead. It's my fault.

18:08.256 --> 18:10.175
I'm still alive, dummy.

18:10.675 --> 18:12.218
Ooh, boy.

18:12.302 --> 18:14.429
Chilchuck, you bagged a Mimic!

18:14.512 --> 18:15.722
Nice going!

18:16.222 --> 18:17.098
Thank you.

18:17.182 --> 18:19.559
What a fine specimen it is.

18:20.226 --> 18:22.020
I never cooked
one of these before.

18:22.103 --> 18:23.605
Can't be too hard.

18:23.688 --> 18:26.399
How do you
even know it's safe to eat?

18:27.067 --> 18:28.860
Don't you worry about that.

18:28.944 --> 18:30.904
The book here says they aren't poisonous.

18:30.987 --> 18:34.157
But they may have poison in them,
depending on their diet.

18:34.240 --> 18:38.078
So without its digestive tract,
it'll be okay for us to eat.

18:39.120 --> 18:41.748
There is nothing okay
about anything you said.

18:42.374 --> 18:44.125
Don't waste your breath, Marcille.

18:44.626 --> 18:46.795
They're gonna cook it,
no matter what you say.

18:46.878 --> 18:50.965
Let them. I don't care,
'cause there's no way I'm gonna eat it!

18:54.886 --> 18:57.055
First, we'll boil a big pot of water.

18:57.806 --> 18:59.516
Then, add some salt.

19:00.642 --> 19:03.186
Stick the Mimic in and pop the lid on.

19:03.770 --> 19:05.230
Then, wait.

19:19.953 --> 19:21.204
Hmm?

19:22.122 --> 19:23.206
Huh?

19:24.124 --> 19:26.960
Should be boiled enough.

19:27.043 --> 19:28.336
It's ready!

19:28.420 --> 19:30.964
BOILED MIMIC

19:34.717 --> 19:37.387
Ugh. It's so hard
to get the meat out of it.

19:37.470 --> 19:39.222
-Try using the other end of that.
-Uh?

19:42.308 --> 19:44.894
No good. Just pushed the meat in further.

19:44.978 --> 19:45.937
Wait.

19:46.021 --> 19:48.898
Chilchuck? Do you mind
if I borrow your thingies?

19:48.982 --> 19:49.858
Thingies?

19:49.941 --> 19:51.693
Those doohickeys you always use.

19:51.776 --> 19:53.027
Your picking tools.

19:53.111 --> 19:55.780
Picking tools. Picking tools.

19:59.200 --> 20:01.369
Are you crazy? No!

20:01.453 --> 20:04.289
Don't worry,
a quick boil should sterilize them.

20:07.333 --> 20:09.752
I'm not worried about that!

20:09.836 --> 20:11.880
No, don't!

20:17.177 --> 20:18.428
That's easy.

20:18.511 --> 20:19.346
EASY TO SCOOP

20:20.430 --> 20:21.723
Here.

20:34.361 --> 20:36.029
It's really good.

20:38.114 --> 20:41.117
Yeah,
this Mimic sure is delicious.

20:41.201 --> 20:44.579
I wonder how the meat from the body
and the leg taste together.

20:46.789 --> 20:48.374
Pretty dang awful.

20:48.458 --> 20:51.628
Yeah, I heard
the crustacean's midgut was icky.

20:51.711 --> 20:53.129
Mm.

20:53.963 --> 20:56.883
If you knew the Mimic was in there,
why didn't you tell us?

20:56.966 --> 21:00.095
I've had nothing
but bad experiences with them.

21:00.178 --> 21:03.389
The last thing I wanted to do
was have to deal with another one.

21:04.015 --> 21:06.517
Anyway, I made a lot of bad decisions.

21:08.603 --> 21:09.562
The first was panicking,

21:09.646 --> 21:12.148
'cause I thought it would eat
the Treasure Insect.

21:12.232 --> 21:14.609
But Mimics don't eat Treasure Insects.

21:14.692 --> 21:15.527
Huh?

21:15.610 --> 21:18.488
Yeah. Treasure Insects eat Mimics.

21:18.571 --> 21:19.822
When it finds a Mimic,

21:19.906 --> 21:23.243
it crawls through an opening in the chest
and lays its eggs.

21:23.326 --> 21:25.995
Then, when the eggs hatch,
the larvae eat the Mimic.

21:26.579 --> 21:28.790
When they mature, they look like treasure.

21:28.873 --> 21:31.334
Someone comes along,
picks them up, and boom,

21:31.417 --> 21:33.127
they're free to find more Mimics.

21:33.628 --> 21:35.588
I hate that you know that.

21:35.672 --> 21:37.799
And stop coddling me! I'm not a kid!

21:37.882 --> 21:40.635
Tell me how old you are
and I'll never do it again.

21:41.302 --> 21:42.595
What happened to you today

21:42.679 --> 21:44.931
happened 'cause you insist
on being secretive.

21:45.014 --> 21:47.809
So, come on now,
and tell me how old you are!

21:49.936 --> 21:50.853
Fine.

21:50.937 --> 21:52.021
Oh?

21:53.648 --> 21:56.025
I'm turning 29 this year.

21:58.111 --> 22:01.948
Ah, you're just a kid after all.
I knew it.

22:02.031 --> 22:04.450
And I thought
you were way older than that.

22:04.534 --> 22:06.703
Okay, then, how old are you guys?

22:06.786 --> 22:09.163
Everyone's a kid
to you races with long lives!

22:11.332 --> 22:12.500
What's your problem?

22:12.584 --> 22:15.169
Should I call you… &quot;sir&quot;?

22:15.253 --> 22:17.297
No! Just call me by my name!

22:17.380 --> 22:20.049
Today's meal was another monster,

22:20.133 --> 22:22.802
but tomorrow, they might be the meal.

22:23.428 --> 22:25.305
Ah, dungeon food.

22:25.388 --> 22:27.682
Delicious in dungeon.

22:27.765 --> 22:28.766
Uh?
